Fix mouse jumping during ADS + shoot (RMB + LMB) and high-polling-rate mouse
input in mouse-look mode:
- Route mouse button, drag and scroll events cleanly through handleEvent: during
  mouseLook so AppKit [super sendEvent:] / contextual menus / didSendEvent:
  updateCursor: never run on in-game clicks or drags.
- Disable AppKit NSEvent mouse coalescing while mouseLook is active so 1000 Hz
  mice deliver true 1 ms deltas instead of 40-170 ms coalesced spikes.
- Skip synchronous WindowServer windowNumbersWithOptions: / grow-box IPC in
  handleMouseButton: and per-move updateCursor: during mouseLook.
- Suppress the initial CGWarpMouseCursorPosition delta leak when entering
  mouseLook.

